msgstr "スクリプトのエラー時の動作（ignore/fail-closed）"

#: src/omega_serv/interfaces/tui/screens/waf_magnet_screen.py:76
msgid ""
"Chemins personnels dissociés (vide = le script garde son propre chemin en "
